        ecrm:P126_employed      "Full leather hollow back sewn on 5 cords.  Leather doublures with gold tooling and in-lays? Parchment free endleaf adhered to paper leaf to form stiff leaved endpapers. Double core endbands worked in a single colour silk.  Untrimmed fore and tail edges.  Head edge gilded with simple gauffering."@en ;
